{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DdWLVtW6om46uKx69YQvzE","type":"tool_result","content":"MOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:134:12: error(lean.unknownIdentifier): Unknown constant `Real.isLittleO_log_rpow_rpow_atTop`\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:133:76: error: unsolved goals\n⊢ Tendsto (fun y => Real.log y ^ 2 / √y) atTop (nhds 0)\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:153:4: error(lean.unknownIdentifier): Unknown constant `Asymptotics.isLittleO_one_iff.mpr`\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:157:29: warning: This simp argument is unused:\n  Pi.mul_apply\n\nHint: Omit it from the simp argument list.\n  [apply] simp only [runtimeScale]\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false`\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:202:60: error: unsolved goals\nn : ℕ\nG : SimpleGraph (Fin n)\nk : ℕ\n⊢ n + (k + (n * n + 1) + 1) = n + 1 + (k + 1) + n * n\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:249:15: error(lean.synthInstanceFailed): failed to synthesize instance of type class\n  DecidableRel G.Adj\n\nHint: Type class instance resolution failures can be inspected with the `set_option trace.Meta.synthInstance true` command.\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:261:42: error(lean.synthInstanceFailed): failed to synthesize instance of type class\n  DecidableRel G.Adj\n\nHint: Type class instance resolution failures can be inspected with the `set_option trace.Meta.synthInstance true` command.\n\nreal\t0m3.646s\nuser\t0m2.020s\nsys\t0m1.419s","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ef12acb-f9ad-4899-992d-6d80c628ee09","uuid":"7ad8268a-62dc-4137-8edf-ba88c561fcc4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T18:48:06.906Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"MOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:134:12: error(lean.unknownIdentifier): Unknown constant `Real.isLittleO_log_rpow_rpow_atTop`\nMOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Frame.lean:133:76: err